            "reviewer_id": "User_p1_0",
            "review_title": "Review at Pastel Cafe",
            "review_text": "Reza R\n3 contributions\n0\nPastel meat and seafood barbecue wors than trash wors than garbages\nMay 2024 • Solo\nThis food was the worst food I was ever served in my life. From the menu I ordered roasted chicken. Before placing my order I asked the owner if this was indeed roasted chicken and fresh. He assured me of both. Chicken was served. Was not roasted. It was cooked in God knows what. And it was harder and tougher than leather. Sincerely this was the most disgusting thing I put in my mouth. I didn't eat it. But they made me pay for it. This place was disgusting and filthy too.\nRead more\nInsider tip:\nTables and kitchen are filthy, the owner is a liar and do not believe anything he says about the food at this filthy horrible place.\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten May 17, 2024",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-11",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
