            "review_title": "Review at Pastel Cafe",
            "review_text": "Айжан Т\n3 contributions\n0\nA successful cafe with drunk staff.\nJan 2024 • Family\nI was with my family in this terrible cafe, I was attracted by a Russian hostess who kindly invited me to dinner. I wanted homemade food, borscht and shashalik, but in the end a drunk Russian man came up and took the order. We waited for more than half an hour, brought a lamb kebab, hard as rubber, streaked with blood, and asked to replace it. They brought it only overcooked and dry. An hour later they asked where our soup and the rest of the kebab were, it turned out they had forgotten it. Well, of course, the man had no time for our kebabs. I don't recommend this place. Waste of money and time.\nRead more\nShow original\nWritten January 21, 2024",
