            "review_text": "Iulia C\n18 contributions\n0\nGreat place to eat in Nha Trang\nJul 2023 • Couples\nGreat location on the second line, nice interior design, really big choice of food for any taste. Delicious food, especially shrimps in passion fruit sause and grilled crocodile🤤. Friendly staff, and the owner is always there serving his guests.\n\nIf you are searching for something healthy to eat for breakfast/brunch, they make fantastic smoothie bowls.\n\nAnd if you are a beer lover, try their fried pork ears as a snack, we've enjoyed it very much.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten July 14, 2023",
